      "Section": "Boost Analytics",
      "Anchor": "boost-analytics",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Deprecation Notice:\nThe Marketing Version 202511 (Marketing November 2025) will be sunset on November 16, 2026. We recommend that you migrate to the latest versioned APIs to avoid disruptions. For information on all the supported versions, refer to the migrations documentation.\nIf you haven\u2019t yet migrated and have questions, submit a request on the LinkedIn Developer Support Portal.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Boost Analytics",
      "Anchor": "boost-analytics",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "All requests use the versioned REST base URL https://api.linkedin.com/rest/, require a member access token, and must include the Linkedin-Version header set to 202610 or a higher available version, and the X-Restli-Protocol-Version: 2.0.0 header. For the full boost workflows, see Member Post Boost and Organization Post Boost.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
